# How a desktop entry gets launched, for every caller. Both the launcher
# popup and the dock used to call entry.execute() directly, which does not
# honour Terminal= — so nvim, and every other terminal application, could be
# clicked and did nothing.
singleton DesktopExec 1.0 DesktopExec.qml
# How an icon name becomes an image, for every surface. Quickshell draws a
# placeholder (and reports Ready) for a name the theme lacks, so each caller's
# own fallback only shows if it asks here first. See the file's header.
singleton IconService 1.0 IconService.qml
